1
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:02,399
Cousin, this place is pretty big.

2
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:06,239
I wonder where exactly the Dragon-Seeking Ruler is hidden.

3
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:16,640
No matter where it's hidden,

4
00:01:17,159 --> 00:01:18,519
it must be

5
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:22,400
waiting for our arrival.

6
00:01:22,879 --> 00:01:24,640
Cousin, you're amazing!

7
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:27,079
Of course. Unlike some people,

8
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:30,319
who have no clue where Funerary objects are placed.

9
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:32,040
Well, I still get to be the Sheng family's son-in-law.

10
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:32,519
You...

11
00:01:32,519 --> 00:01:33,920
Enough. Let's go.

12
00:01:34,799 --> 00:01:35,519
Slow down.

13
00:01:46,599 --> 00:01:47,959
Honestly, cousin,

14
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:50,239
if we weren't accompanying you on your first geomancy trip,

15
00:01:50,239 --> 00:01:51,519
to a small place like this,

16
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,920
my brother wouldn't even bother coming himself.

17
00:01:58,560 --> 00:01:59,799
Look at this!

18
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:09,479
Bringing this loser along is just bad luck.

19
00:02:09,599 --> 00:02:11,840
Even the coffin we found is a miniature version.

20
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:16,159
Rat,

21
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:18,639
get to work.

22
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:20,360
We need to pry it open.

23
00:02:53,879 --> 00:02:54,599
Hold on.

24
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,960
Something doesn't seem right about this thing.

25
00:03:00,719 --> 00:03:01,360
Ling Yu,

26
00:03:01,560 --> 00:03:03,199
bring out the treasure yourself.

27
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,759
Cousin!

28
00:03:05,759 --> 00:03:08,159
Don't be scared. Cousin is here, everything's fine.

29
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:28,120
This coffin is just one layer, the Outer coffin.

30
00:03:28,919 --> 00:03:31,000
This Earthenware urn is the real coffin.

31
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,599
Ling Yu.

32
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,840
Something's wrong with this thing.

33
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,719
What do you know, you jinx?

34
00:03:36,919 --> 00:03:38,360
It's fine, cousin.

35
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,240
Go ahead and open it.

36
00:03:39,560 --> 00:03:41,520
We've got our brother's overlord aura protecting us.

37
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:01,120
Who?

38
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:02,520
Who touched me?

39
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:03,719
What is it now?

40
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:04,560
Brother!

41
00:04:04,759 --> 00:04:07,280
A hand just touched me from behind.

42
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,840
Young Master Qi.

43
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,639
Using an Earthenware urn as a coffin usually suppresses monsters.

44
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,319
I don't think we should let Ling Yu take the risk.

45
00:04:18,920 --> 00:04:19,839
What do you mean?

46
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:22,480
You don't want Ling Yu to open the coffin?

47
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,439
Are you just eager to take the credit for yourself?

48
00:04:28,199 --> 00:04:29,600
I've got the Qi Family's Corpse-Suppressing Talisman on it.

49
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,839
Don't worry, just reach in.

50
00:04:38,519 --> 00:04:39,399
Who? Who? Who?

51
00:04:39,399 --> 00:04:40,680
Who touched me again?

52
00:04:41,639 --> 00:04:43,879
Can you stop being so jumpy in a place like this?

53
00:04:43,879 --> 00:04:45,240
Acting all paranoid.

54
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:51,759
It's nothing. Come on.

55
00:05:06,759 --> 00:05:07,560
What's wrong?

56
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,879
What's wrong, Ling Yu?

57
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:12,600
A little hand grabbed me and won't let go!

58
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,759
What little hand?

59
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:17,959
It's alright. You're fine.

60
00:05:23,079 --> 00:05:24,759
Are you alright?

61
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,600
Are you okay?

62
00:05:33,360 --> 00:05:34,160
I'm fine!

63
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,120
Get up!

64
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,240
They're raising an Imp in this urn!

65
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,040
Smash the urn and save her!

66
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,720
You think I don't know how to smash it?

67
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,560
I don't need you to tell me!

68
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:47,680
Why isn't it working?!

69
00:05:47,759 --> 00:05:49,120
It's like reinforced concrete!

70
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:50,240
Get up!

71
00:05:53,199 --> 00:05:54,759
Tianyou, save me!

72
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:37,480
What is that thing?

73
00:06:41,279 --> 00:06:42,839
The Dragon-Seeking Ruler isn't here.

74
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:50,240
Zhang Tianyou!

75
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:52,639
How did you do that just now?

76
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:55,319
I don't know either.

77
00:06:56,319 --> 00:06:57,439
I just felt like...

78
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,680
it was about to break.

79
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:01,399
Stop bragging.

80
00:07:01,399 --> 00:07:03,399
I obviously hit it so many times,

81
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:04,519
and you just lightly touched it at the end

82
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:05,639
and it broke.

83
00:07:05,959 --> 00:07:06,959
Right, right, right.

84
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,959
He broke it, he broke it.

85
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:15,959
Brother!

86
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:17,160
What is this?

87
00:07:20,279 --> 00:07:21,079
What is that thing?

88
00:07:21,759 --> 00:07:22,600
What is that thing?!

89
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:24,680
Don't worry.

90
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,000
Our Qi family still has Life-saving talismans.

91
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:28,959
Look, better now?

92
00:07:29,360 --> 00:07:30,120
I have more.

93
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:31,040
I have plenty more talismans.

94
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:32,399
They can all save our lives.

95
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:33,360
One for you.

96
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,199
I'll stick one on too.

97
00:07:34,319 --> 00:07:35,040
One for you.

98
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,079
One for me.

99
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:40,199
One for you, one for me.

100
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:43,720
One for you, one for me, one for you.

101
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,920
Another one for you, another one for me.

102
00:07:46,160 --> 00:07:48,680
One for you, one for me, one for you.

103
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:51,319
Young Master Qi, stop sticking them.

104
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,839
Put two on your brother.

105
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,120
What happened to him?

106
00:08:01,279 --> 00:08:02,279
Even his hairstyle changed.

107
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:15,079
Madam, what's wrong?

108
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:16,360
I'm fine.

109
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:30,600
Could it be...

110
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:33,559
a Talisman Alert?

111
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,000
Things look grim.

112
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,799
This is bad!

113
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,080
I'm—

114
00:08:58,159 --> 00:08:59,240
I'm fine, I'm fine, I'm fine.

115
00:09:15,759 --> 00:09:17,440
It's okay.

116
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,399
Cousin is here.

117
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:20,440
It's okay. It's okay, it's okay.
